secutive days.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight.\n\nPACKAGING:\n250 and 100 grams', 1),
(13, 4, 'TRIMEDIAZ', 'TRIMEDIAZ', 'trimediaz', 'products/01JZ07054EF9XVMVM2G2FK4P3C.jpg', 'products/01JWMASX9PXF30RPDNPZ60G754.png', 'products/01JZVHM1E5CTTXKDQ6SDTZX915.jpg', 'products/01JWMASX9SA6GAM7FKFE3CQ846.png', 'products/01JZVHM1E8DPPY8VW26ZTAZ9K5.jpg', '2025-05-31 16:28:33', '2025-07-19 01:40:14', 'TRIMEDIAZ®\nObat CRD Kompleks\nKementan RI: No. D.230672180PKS\n\nPencegahan dan Pengobatan:\nCoryza\n\nKolera\n\nColibasillosis\n\nSalmonelosis\n\nPullorum\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA \nSADITA\nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan \nBizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, \nJawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id\n', 'TRIMEDIAZ®\nCRD Complex Drugs  \nKementan RI: No. D.230672180PKS\n\nPrevention and Treatment of Coryza,\nCholera,\n\nColibacillosis,\n\nSalmonellosis,\n\nPullorum\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'TRIMEDIAZ®\nObat CRD Kompleks\n\nINDIKASI:\nPencegahan dan Pengobatan Coryza, Kolera, Colibasillosis,\nSalmonelosis, Pullorum\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap 1 kg mengandung: \nTrimethoprim .............................................................. 40 gram\nSulfadiazine ............................................................. 200 gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nTrimethoprim mencegah pembentukan asam folinat \npada sel bakteri tanpa mengganggu metabolisme folat \npada hewan. Trimethoprim dan sulfadiazine bekerja \nsaling memperkuat dan efek antibakterinya diperbesar \ndari masing-masing komponen. Hasil kedua gabungan \nini adalah bakterisidal, sedangkan apabila komponen \nini bekerja secara terpisah (sendiri-sendiri) akan \nbersifat bakteriostatik\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI:\nUnggas: Larutkan satu gram Trimediaz kedalam 2 liter \nair minum, diberikan selama 5 hari berturut-turut.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN:\n100 & 250 gram', 'TRIMEDIAZ®\nCRD Complex Drugs\n\nINDICATION:\nPrevention and treatment of coryza, cholera, colibacillosis, salmonellosis, and pullorum disease.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEvery 1 kg contains:\nTrimethoprim .................................................. 40 grams\nSulfadiazine .................................................. 200 grams\n\nHOW THE DRUG WORKS:\nTrimethoprim prevents the formation of folinic acid in bacterial cells without interfering with folate metabolism in animals. Trimethoprim and sulfadiazine work to strengthen each other and the antibacterial effect of each component is magnified. The result of these two combined is bactericidal, whereas if these components work separately (individually) they will be bacteriostatic.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nPoultry: Dissolve 1 gram of Trimediaz in 2 liters of drinking water, the treatment is given for 5 consecutive days.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight.\n\nPACKAGING:\n250 grams and 100 grams', 1),
(14, 4, 'TYLOPRIM 15', 'TYLOPRIM 15', 'tyloprim', 'products/01JZ0727TN2D0PJGDWTXRG4EJG.jpg', 'products/01JWMBNNJTEETP4AVQD9MDF133.png', 'products/01K0GXZGCSV9VBZGY31TPYB00M.jpg', 'products/01JWMBNNJY32B46EF65SQGXAY1.png', 'products/01K0GXZGDB1EH3A797270VPRVM.jpg', '2025-05-31 16:43:42', '2025-07-19 01:49:45', 'TYLOPRIM 15®\nMengobati diare dan radang saluran pencernaan\nKEMENTAN RI : No. D.21097071 PKS\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan \nBizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, \nJawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'TYLOPRIM 15®\nTreating diarrhea and inflammation of the digestive tract\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'TYLOPRIM 15®\nMengobati diare dan radang saluran pencernaan\n\nINDIKASI:\nSebagai antibakteri yang peka terhadap Tylosin.\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap 1 gram mengandung: \nTilosin Tartrat .................................................................. 150 g\nDextroseanhdrous ...................................................... Ad 1 kg\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nTylosin adalah antibiotik golongan macrolide, disintesa \ndari jamur streptomyces fradiae, yang bersifat \nbakteriostatik bekerja dengan cara memutus sintesa \nprotein bakteri. Tylosin merupakan obat pilihan untuk \nmengobati penyakit karena infeksi bakteri Gram positif \ndan Gram negatif.\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI:\nUnggas: berikan melalui air minum dengan dosis 10 \nmg/kg BB atau 1 gram per 2 liter air minum selama 5 \nhari berturut-turut.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN:\n100 gr, 250 gr, & 500 gram', 'TYLOPRIM 15®\nTreating diarrhea and inflammation of the digestive tract\n\nINDICATION:\nAs an antibacterial that is sensitive to Tylosin.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach 1 gram contains:\nTylosin Tartrate .................................................... 150g\nDextrose anhydrous ............................................ Ad 1 kg\n\nHOW THE DRUG WORKS:\nTylosin is a macrolide antibiotic, synthesized from the fungus streptomyces fradiae, which is bacteriostatic and works by breaking down bacterial protein synthesis. Tylosin is the drug of choice for treating diseases caused by Gram-positive and Gram-negative bacterial infections.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nPoultry: give through drinking water at a dose of 10 mg/kg BW or 1 gram per 2 liters of drinking water for 5 consecutive days.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight.\n\nPACKAGING:\n100 gr, 250 gr, & 500 grams', 1),
