, Haemonchus sp, Heterakis sp, Syngamus sp, Oesophagostomum sp, Strongylus sp, Uncimeria sp and Taenia sp.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach liter contains:\nAlbendazole ............................................................... 100 grams\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nAdminister via drinking water,\nFor Cattle : 1 ml per 10 kg body weight\nFor Goats : 0.75 ml per 10 kg body weight\nFor Poultry : 1 ml per 2.2 kg body weight\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight.\n\nPACKAGING:\n1 liter & 100 ml', 1),
(16, 6, 'CLOVAMID', 'CLOVAMID', 'clovamid', 'products/01JZ07W78DKP8K4DVJ596B8S64.jpg', 'products/01JWMBX3ETXA6ZRATQ2PEDECQ9.png', 'products/01JZVHZEBY7WXF9XH3XR9N7GV9.jpg', 'products/01JWMBX3EXE44YE58YYNHCNDFX.png', 'products/01JZVHZEC1Z98B0261JJ76Z93R.jpg', '2025-05-31 16:47:46', '2025-12-07 08:55:36', 'CLOVAMID®\nObat Cacing Pita & Cacing Gelang\nKementan RI: No. D.16095152PKS\n\nMembasmi cacing Ascaris,\nHeterakis Gallinarum,\n\nCapillaria Obsignata,\n\nRaillietina sp,\n\ndll. pada unggas\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan \nBizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, \nJawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'CLOVAMID®\nTaperworm & Roundworm Medicine\nKementan RI: No. D.16095152PKS\n\nEradicate Ascaris worms, \nHeterakis Gallinarum, \n\nCapillaria Obsignata, \n\nRaillietina sp, etc. in poultry.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'CLOVAMID®\nObat Cacing Pita & Cacing Gelang\n\nINDIKASI:\nMembasmi cacing Ascaris, Heterakis Gallinarum, Capillaria \nObsignata, Raillietina sp, dll. pada unggas.\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap kilogram mengandung:\nLevamisole .................................................................. 50 gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nNiclosamide dan Levamisole digunakan untuk membasmi \nsemua jenis cacing, baik cacing pita maupun cacing gelang \npada unggas.\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI:\nUnggas: 4-6 kg CLOVAMID per ton pakan atau 0,5 gram per \nkilogram berat badan.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN:\n1 kg, 500 gr & 100 gr\n', 'CLOVAMID®\nTaperworm & Roundworm Medicine\n\nINDICATION:\nEradicate Ascaris worms, Heterakis Gallinarum, Capillaria Obsignata, Raillietina sp, etc. in poultry.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach kilogram contains:\nLevamisole ............................................................... 50 grams\n\nHOW MEDICATION WORKS:\nNiclosamide and Levamisole are used to eradicate all types of worms, both tapeworms and roundworms in poultry.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nPoultry: 4-6 kg CLOVAMID per ton of feed or 0.5 grams per kilogram of body weight.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight.\n\nPACKAGING:\n10 kg, 200 gr, 100 gr', 1),
(17, 6, 'DITA LARVACID', 'DITA LARVACID', 'dita-larvacid', 'products/01JZ07XGXPEGPEC77R306B3647.jpg', 'products/01JWMC3JB4TDR0TE0WDCKAA2YM.png', 'products/01JZVJ0D619Y4ZHK4JAS4N9Z6V.jpg', 'products/01JWMC3JB77NGGHVX1QW3X7H8C.png', 'products/01JZVJ0D646DVHNBWPH68HYRSZ.jpg', '2025-05-31 16:51:18', '2025-07-19 03:52:40', 'DITA LARVACID 1%®\nObat Pembasmi Larva Lalat\nKEMENTAN RI No. D.25075012FTS.1\n\nMenghambat pertumbuhan :\nlarva lalatyang hidup pada kotoran unggas\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA \nSADITA\nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan \nBizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, \nJawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA LARVACID 1%®\nFly Larva Repellent\nKEMENTAN RI No. D.15095012 FTS\n\nInhibits the growth of fly larvae that lives in poultry droppings\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id\n', 'DITA LARVACID 1%®\nObat Pembasmi Larva Lalat\n\nINDIKASI:\nMenghambat pertumbuhan larva lalat yang hidup pada \nkotoran unggas.\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap 1 kg mengandung: \nSiromazin ...................................................................... 10 gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nSiromazin merupakan derivate Triazine, sebagai regulator \nperkembangan insekta yang bekerja dengan cara merusak \nsystem syaraf larva lalat. Cyromazine digunakan pada obat \nhewan untuk melindungi hewan terhadap serangan insekta. \nEfektif untuk mengendalikan telur dan larva lalat. Cyromazine \ncepat diabsorbsi dan cepat diekskresikan melalui urin dan \nfeses.\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI:\nCampurkan 250-500 gram DITA LARVACID 1%® per ton pakan.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN:\n100 gr & 1 kg', 'DITA LARVACID 1%®\nFly Larva Repellent\n\nINDICATION:\nInhibits the growth of fly larvae that live in poultry droppings\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEvery 1 kg contains:\nCyromazine ................................................................ 10 grams\n\nHOW MEDICATION WORKS:\nCyromazine is a triazine derivative, a regulator of insect development which works by damaging the nervous system of fly larvae. Cyromazine is used in veterinary medicine to protect animals against insect attacks. Effective for controlling fly eggs and larvae. Cyromazine is rapidly absorbed and rapidly excreted in urine and feces\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nMix 250-500 grams of DITA LARVACID 1% per ton of feed\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n1 kilograms dan 100 grams', 1),
(18, 6, 'DITA TOLTRIL', 'DITA TOLTRIL', 'dita-toltril', 'products/01JZ07YNA1KQRMQ9GPCG7RYGR9.jpg', 'products/01JWMC618C7BPVQYD4P35ANDN4.png', 'products/01JZVJ19TXP3NBCNYSTGKG9P0D.jpg', 'products/01JWMC618EAHRYTAWS8TJHBFKB.png', 'products/01JZVJ19TZPZSVZRS7NTR3HXSQ.jpg', '2025-05-31 16:52:38', '2025-07-19 04:01:39', 'DITA TOLTRIL-25®\nMengatasi penyakit coccidiosis (berak darah) secara total\nKementan RI: No. D.16045067PKC\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA \nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan \nBizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, \nJawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA TOLTRIL-25®\nTreat coccidiosis (bloody stools) completely\nKementan RI: No. D.16045067PKC\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id\n', 'DITA TOLTRIL-25®\nMengatasi penyakit coccidiosis (berak darah) secara total\n\nINDIKASI:\nMengatasi penyakit coccidiosis (berak darah) secara total\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap liter mengandung: \nToltrazuril ..................................................................... 25 gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nToltrazuril adalah derivat triazinetrione sebagai cocci-diostat, \nantiprotozoa agen, efektif membasmi Coccidia. Bekerja pada \nsemua fase intraseluler dari Coccidia.\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI:\n1 ml per liter air minum, berikan satu kali sehari selama 2-3 \nhari berturut-turut.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN:\n100 ml, 250 ml, & 1 liter\n', 'DITA TOLTRIL-25®\nTreat coccidiosis (bloody stools) completely\n\nINDICATION:\nTreat coccidiosis (bloody stools) completely\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach liter contains:\nToltrazuril .................................................................. 25 grams\n\nHOW MEDICATION WORKS:\nToltrazuril is a triazinetrione derivative as a cocci-diostat, antiprotozoal agent, effectively eradicating Coccidia. Works on all intracellular phases of Coccidia.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\n1 ml per liter of drinking water, give once a day for 2-3 consecutive days.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n100 ml, 250 ml, & 1 liter', 1),
(19, 5, 'DITA BOLASE', 'DITA BOLASE', 'dita-bolase', 'products/01JZ0807FY6XA5BS5E41MXGHZ0.jpg', 'products/01JWMCDDXV45HYS6NBXNVTX06J.png', 'products/01JZVJDZVG8Y0ZPY6F9VN75CPT.jpg', 'products/01JWMCDDXYSQQKMC0YE907ER39.png', 'products/01JZVJDZVKKRCPVXTQ8W74361J.jpg', '2025-05-31 16:56:41', '2025-07-19 22:27:05', 'DITA BOLASE® \nEnergizer & Stimulan Metabolisme\nKementan RI: No. D.15125035PTC\n\nSumber energi untuk memacu pertumbuhan dan mengurangi \nkasus kekerdilan, mengurangi stress, meninggkatkan daya \ntahan tubuh, meningkatkan metabolisme dan produktivitas.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA BOLASE®\nEnergizer & Metabolism Stimulant\nKementan RI: No. D.15125035PTC\n\nA source of energy that stimulates growth and reduces stunting, reduces stress, increases body endurance, boosts metabolism, and enhances productivity.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id\n\n', 'DITA BOLASE®\nEnergizer & Stimulan Metabolisme\n\nINDIKASI:\n- Sumber energi untuk memacu pertumbuhan dan \nmengurangi kasus kekerdilan\n- Mengurangi stress secara umum\n- Meningkatkan daya tahan tubuh\n- Meningkatkan metabolisme dan produktivitas\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap liter mengandung: .\nL- Carnitine HCI ................................................................ 20 gr\nSorbitol .............................................................................. 50 gr\nVitamin B1 ..................................................................... 500 mg\nVitamin B2 .................................................................. 2.500 mg\nVitamin B6 ....................................................................... 50 mg\nVitamin B12 ................................................................... 50 mcg\nVitamin C .................................................................... 1.500 mg\nNicotinamide .............................................................. 6.000 mg\nLysin ........................................................................... 5.000 mg\nMetionin .................................................................... 5.000 mg.\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI:\nUnggas: Larutkan sebanyak 2 ml / 2 liter air minum, \ndiberikan selama 5-7 hari berturut-turut.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN:\n1 liter dan 100 ml', 'DITA BOLASE®\nEnergizer & Stimulan Metabolisme\n\nINDICATION:\nA source of energy to stimulate growth and reduce cases of --stunting\n-Reduces stress\n-Increases body endurance\n-Increases metabolism and productivity\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach liter contains:\nL- Carnitine HCl ................................................................ 20 gr\nSorbitol ............................................................................. 50 gr\nVitamin B1 ..................................................................... 500 mg\nVitamin B2 .................................................................. 2.500 mg\nVitamin B6 ..................................................................... 50 mg\nVitamin B12 ................................................................... 50 mcg\nVitamin C .................................................................... 1.500 mg\nNicotinamide .............................................................. 6.000 mg\nLysin ........................................................................... 5.000 mg\nMethionine ................................................................. 5.000 mg\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nPoultry: Dissolve 2 ml / 2 liters of drinking water, the treatment is given for 5-7 consecutive days.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n1 liter and 100 ml', 1),
(20, 5, 'DITA C LIQ', 'DITA C LIQ', 'dita-c-liq', 'products/01JZ081JT18DRQFFNDRG17RVBX.jpg', 'products/01JWMCGB26ECTGQZ1V6JNY97A2.png', 'products/01K0K5D6N1WJJYSKF7XP3QQRV8.jpg', 'products/01JWMCGB29H573GAJN0SSQVJ6X.png', 'products/01K0K5D6N4K7H2ENQC9Y7V5MDE.jpg', '2025-05-31 16:58:16', '2025-07-19 22:37:46', 'DITA C LIQ®\nAntidefisiensi Vitamin dan Mineral\nKementan RI: No. D.25038088 FTC\n\nMeningkatkan kesehatan dengan mencegah dehidrasi, \nmemulihkan pencernaan, meningkatkan imun, dan menurunkan \nstres.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA C LIQ®\nAntideficiency Vitamins and Minerals\nKementan RI: No. D.25038088 FTC\n\nImproves health by preventing dehydration, restoring digestion, increasing immunity, and reducing stress.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA C LIQ®\nAntidefisiensi Vitamin dan Mineral\n\nINDIKASI:\n- Mencegah dehidrasi\n- Memulihkan fungsi pencernaan\n- Meningkatkan sisetm imun\n- Memulihkan kondisi tubuh\n- Memperbaiki kerabang telur\n- Menurunkan stress\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap liter mengandung:\nVitamin C ............................................................................ 100 g\nNaCl ................................................................................... 46,88 g\nKCl ........................................................................................ 9,64 g\nMgSO4.7H2O ....................................................................... 4,75 g\nSorbitol ................................................................................ 200 g\nAquadest ...................................................................... Ad 1 Liter\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nVitamin C sangat penting untuk membantu tubuh \nberfungsi normal. Sebagai antioksidan, Vitamin C akan \nberperan sebagai pelindung alami dari serangan penyakit. \nKandungan bahan organik dan enzim aktifnya membantu \nsebagai anti-stress dengan proses akami.\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI:\nLarutkan 1 ml ke dalam 2 liter air minum, diberikan \nselama 5 sampai 7 hari berturut-turut.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN:\n1 Liter', 'DITA C LIQ®\nAntideficiency Vitamins and Minerals\n\nINDICATION:\n-Prevent dehydration\n-Restore digestive function\n-Improve immune system\n-Restore body condition\n-Improve egg shells\n-Reduce stress\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach liter contains:\nVitamin C ................................................................................... 100 g\nNaCl ......................................................................................... 46.888 g\nKCl ........................................................................................... 63 g\nMgSO4.7H2O ............................................................................. 4.75 g\nSorbitol .................................................................................... 200 g\nAquadest .................................................................................. Ad 1 liter\n\nHOW MEDICATION WORKS:\nVitamin C is essential to help the body function normally. As an antioxidant, Vitamin C will act as a natural protector from disease attacks. Its organic content and active enzymes will help as an anti-stress with the alam process.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nDissolve 1 ml in 2 liters of drinking water, the treatment is given for 5 to 7 consecutive days.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n1 Liter', 1),
(21, 5, 'DITA NOSTRESS', 'DITA NOSTRESS', 'dita-nostress', 'products/01JZ082TH4D472B98AE0KPEXA2.jpg', 'products/01JWMCJ454YQJ69ETABNYFWNX6.png', 'products/01JZVJH0B32R7SKEZ847VZEG5G.jpg', 'products/01JWMCJ457Q222J0T3K3D6SJ35.png', 'products/01JZVJH0B6QADTEA9S8GZKD7ZS.jpg', '2025-05-31 16:59:15', '2025-07-19 22:45:42', 'DITA NOSTRESS®\nObat Anti Stress\nKementan RI: No. D.16095151PTS\n\nMenanggulangi stress umum (Vaksinasi, Potong Paruh, \nTransportasi, Pindah Kandang dan Cuaca ekstrim), \nMeningkatkan daya tahan tubuh terhadap serangan penyakit\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA NOSTRESS®\nAnti-Stress Medication\nKementan RI: No. D. 16095151 PTS\n\nOvercoming general stress (Vaccination, Beak Cutting, Transportation, Moving Cages and Extreme Weather), Increasing the body\'s resistance to disease attacks.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA NOSTRESS®\nObat Anti Stress\n\nINDIKASI:\n- Menanggulangi stress umum (vaksinasi, potong paruh, \ntransportasi, pindah kandang dan cuaca)\n- Meningkatkan daya tahan tubuh terhadap serangan \npenyakit.\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap kg mengandung:\nVitamin A ............................................................ 10.000.000 IU\nVitamin D3 ............................................................... 200.000 IU\nVitamin E .................................................................. 10.000 mg\nKalium ............................................................................... 100 g\nNatrium ............................................................................... 50 g\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nKandungan vitamin dan mineral membantu \nmeningkatkan daya tahan tubuh dan metabolisme agar \nkembali normal.\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI:\nUnggas: 1 gram/ 2-4 liter air minum, diberikan selama 3-5 \nhari berturut-turut, ulangi setelah 2 minggu.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN:\n500 gr, 250 gr, 100 gr & 1 kg', 'DITA NOSTRESS®\nAnti-Stress Medication\n\nINDICATION:\n-Dealing with general stress (vaccinations, beak trimming, \n-transportation, moving cages and weather)\n-Increase the body\'s resistance to disease attacks\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach kg contains:\nVitamin A ........................................................... 10.000.000 IU\nVitamin D3 .............................................................. 200.000 IU\nVitamin E .................................................................. 10.000 mg\nPotassium ........................................................................ 100 g\nSodium ............................................................................... 50 g\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nThe vitamin and mineral content helps increase the body\'s endurance and metabolism to return to normal.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n500 gr, 250 gr, 100 gr & 1 kg', 1);
