(22, 5, 'DITA EGG PRO', 'DITA EGG PRO', 'dita-egg-pro', 'products/01JZ083Z8GP2FQ4SPX1ZJXFK4M.jpg', 'products/01JWMCMTJJZRDPGACFFPK0HG1H.png', 'products/01JZVJHSHJW1RD1SGYVXTZV60J.jpg', 'products/01JWMCMTJPT2G01ETRGKSDYPJ1.png', 'products/01JZVJHSHNSDGPVQA672X1B082.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:00:43', '2025-07-19 22:53:31', 'DITA EGG PRO®\nPemacu Produksi Telur\nKementan RI: No. D.22107616PTS\n\nMeningkatkan produksi telur, memperpanjang masa produksi \ntelur, mempertahankan produksi puncak, memperbaiki kualitas \nkerabang telur dan karkas, meningkatkan daya tahan tubuh, \nmemperbaiki konversi pakan.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA EGG PRO®\nEgg Production Booster\nKementan RI: No. D.22107616PTS\n\nIncreases egg production, extends egg production period, maintain peak production, improves egg shell and carcass quality, increases body endurance, improves feed conversion.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA EGG PRO®\nPemacu Produksi Telur\n\nINDIKASI:\n- Meningkatkan produksi telur\n- Memperpanjang masa produksi telur\n- Meningkatkan daya tahan tubuh\n- Memperbaiki konversi pakan\n- Memperbaiki kualitas kerabang dan karkas\n- Mempertahankan produksi puncak\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap kg mengandung: .\nCarnitine ..................................................................... 10.000 mg\nVitamin A ............................................................... 10.000.000 IU\nVitamin D3 ............................................................. 2.000.000 IU\nVitamin E ...................................................................... 7.500 mg\nVitamin K3 .................................................................... 3.500 mg\nVitamin B2 .................................................................... 6.000 mg\nVitamin B6 .................................................................... 4.000 mg\nVitamin B12 ...................................................................... 30 mcg\nCa-d-Pantothenate .................................................. 10.000 mg\nNiacin .......................................................................... 20.000 mg\nFolic Acid ......................................................................... 250 mg\nDextrose Anhydrous ...................................................... Ad 1 Kg\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI:\nUnggas: 1 gram/ 2-4 liter air minum, diberikan selama 3-5 \nhari berturut-turut, ulangi setelah 2 minggu.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN:\n250 & 100 gram', 'DITA EGG PRO®\nEgg Production Booster\n\nINDICATION:\n-Increases egg production\n-Extends the egg production period\n-Increases body endurance\n-Improves feed conversion\n-Improves shell and carcass quality\n-Maintain peak production\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach kg contains:\nCarnitine ................................................................................... 10.000 mg\nVitamin A ................................................................................... 10.000.000 IU\nVitamin D3 ................................................................................. 2.000.000 IU\nVitamin E ................................................................................... 7.500 IU\nVitamin K3 ................................................................................. 3.500 mg\nVitamin B2 ................................................................................. 6.000 mg\nVitamin B6 ................................................................................. 4.000 mg\nVitamin B12 ............................................................................... 30 mcg\nCa-d-Pantothenate .................................................................... 10.000 mg\nBiotin ........................................................................................ 20.000 mcg\nFolic Acid .................................................................................. 250 mg\nDextrose Anhydrous .................................................................. Ad 1 Kg\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nPoultry: 1 gram / 2-4 liters of drinking water, the treatment is given for 3-5 consecutive days, repeat after 2 weeks.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n250 & 100 gram', 1),
(23, 5, 'DITA SEL E-LIQ', 'DITA SEL E-LIQ', 'dita-sel-e-liq', 'products/01JZ085AQFWJZNRF41BZFE2CB7.jpg', 'products/01JWMCQ9D3E17X7GHE46DRSKR4.png', 'products/01JZVJJM7N2BWAFXT2KBTDJC28.jpg', 'products/01JWMCQ9D6YEGKZHWG7T2A9FRK.png', 'products/01JZVJJM7SS3BCB9N96193WTH3.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:02:04', '2025-07-19 23:18:32', 'DITA SE-E 120 LIQ®\nPertumbuhan Unggas & Ternak\nKementan RI: No. D.22117629FTC\n\nMemperbaiki siklus reproduksi yang tidak teratur, \nMenumbuhkan jengger, Mengobati White Muscle Disease; Silent \nheat; Abortus; Crazy Chicken Disease.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA SE-E 120 LIQ®\nPoultry & Livestock Growth\nKementan RI: No. D.22117629FTC\n\nCorrecting irregular reproductive cycles, Growing combs, Treating White Muscle Disease; Silent heat; Abortion; Crazy Chicken Disease.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA SE-E 120 LIQ®\nPertumbuhan Unggas & Ternak\n\nINDIKASI:\nMemperbaiki siklus reproduksi yang tidak teratur, \nMenumbuhkan jengger, Mengobati White Muscle Disease \n(penyakit otot ternak); Silent heat (birahi tenang); Abortus; \nCrazy Chicken Disease.\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap kg mengandung:\nVitamin E ........................................................................... 120.000 mg \nSelenium................................................................................ 2.200 mg \nSorbitol .......................................................................................... 100 g\nPropyleneglycol ........................................................................... 100 g\nAquadest ...................................................................................... Ad 1 L\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nVitamin E sangat penting untuk berbagai fungsi fisiologi tubuh, \ndan antioksidan yang dapat melindungi dinding pembuluh \ndarah.\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI:\nUnggas : 1 ml/per 10 liter air minum diberikan selama 5 hari. \nTernak (sapi, kuda, domba, kambing) : 5 ml per hari selama 3 \nhari.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN:\n100 ml & 1 liter', 'DITA SE-E 120 LIQ®\nPoultry & Livestock Growth\n\nINDICATION:\nCorrecting irregular reproductive cycles, growing combs, treating white muscle disease (cattle muscle disease); Silent heat (quiet lust); Abortion; Crazy Chicken Disease.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach kg contains:\nVitamin E ................................................................................... 120.000 mg\nSelenium .................................................................................... 2.200 mg\nSorbitol ...................................................................................... 100 g\nPropyleneglycol ......................................................................... 100 g\nAquadest ................................................................................... Ad 1 L\n\nHOW THE DRUG WORKS:\nVitamin E is very important for various physiological functions of the body, and is an antioxidant that can protect blood vessel walls.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nPoultry: 1 ml/per 10 liters of drinking water, the treatment is given for 5 days. Livestock (cattle, horses, sheep, goats): 5 ml per day for 3 days.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n250 ml & 1 Liter', 1),
