.................. 3.150 mg\nNaCl ................................................................................. 3.545 mg\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI:\nUnggas: Larutkan sebanyak 1 ml / 2 liter air minum, \ndiberikan selama 3-5 hari berturut-turut.\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN:\n1 liter dan 100 ml', 'DITA SORBITOL+®\nEnergizer & Metabolism Stimulant\n\nINDICATION:\nEnergy source to accelerate growth and reduce cases of stunting\nIncrease and improve metabolism and productivity\nIncrease body endurance\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach kg contains:\nSorbitol ...................................................................................... 100 gr\nVitamin B1 ................................................................................. 2.000 mg\nVitamin B2 ................................................................................. 2.500 mg\nVitamin B6 ................................................................................. 2.500 mg\nVitamin B12 ............................................................................... 4.000 mg\nKCl ............................................................................................ 3.150 mg\nNaCl .......................................................................................... 3.545 mg\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nPoultry: Dissolve 1 ml / 2 liters of drinking water, the treatment is given for 3-5 consecutive days.\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n1 liter dan 100 ml', 1),
