n terlindung dari cahaya matahari.\nKEMASAN\n100 gram\n\nSADITA\nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan', 'APHTHOCLYN®\nAnti-Apthovirus PMK Ointment\n\nINDICATIONS\nDestroys apthovirus PMK in cattle hooves and mouths\nKills bacteria on the surface of cattle hooves\nReduces bacterial & viral contamination\n\nCOMPOSITION\nEach 1 kg contains:\n\nOxytetracycline .................................................................... 3%\n\nAcidifying Agent ................................................................. 1.5%\n\nHOW THE MEDICINE WORKS\nApply to wounds on the feet and mouth of cattle\nFor PMK outbreak management, apply 2-3 times daily\nEnsure hooves remain dry at all times\nFor more effective cleaning, remove dirt from the skin surface before application\n\nSTORAGE\nStore in a dry place protected from sunlight.\nPACKAGING\n100 grams\n\nSADITA\nManufacturer & Distributor of Veterinary Medicines', 1),
