.. 0,03 gr\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI\nCampurkan 1 sachet GIZCOW dengan 2,5 L air dan tambahkan rumput cacah untuk pakan sapi. Bisa juga dicampurkan dengan konsentrat pakan sapi. Untuk penanganan wabah PMK diberikan 2–3 kali sehari.\n\nPENYIMPANAN\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terlindung dari cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN\n500 gram\n\nSADITA\nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan', 'GIZCOW®\nNutritional Porridge for Cattle\n\nINDICATIONS\n\nImproves cattle stamina and appetite\n\nBoosts cattle antibodies when infected with viral diseases\n\nAccelerates the recovery process for cattle\n\nCOMPOSITION\nEach kilogram contains:\nVitamin A ............................................... 10 g\nVitamin E ............................................... 10 g\nVitamin B1 ............................................ 0.03 g\nVitamin B2 ............................................ 0.03 g\nVitamin B6 ............................................ 0.03 g\nNicotinamide ........................................ 0.23 g\nDl-Methionine ..................................... 5 g\nL-Lysine ................................................ 0.03 g\n\nDOSAGE AND USAGE INSTRUCTIONS\nMix 1 sachet of GIZCOW with 2.5 L of water and add chopped grass for cattle feed. It can also be mixed with cattle feed concentrate. For PMK outbreak treatment, administer 2–3 times a day.\n\nSTORAGE\nStore in a dry place protected from sunlight.\n\nPACKAGING\n500 grams\n\nSADITA\nManufacturer & Distributor of Animal Medicines', 1),
(32, 8, 'DITA BENZAL', 'DITA BENZAL', 'dita-benzal', 'products/01JZ091CM16PKR1PNQ02TYC7FE.jpg', 'products/01JWMDEQTSMBSE91CVVBBJE2N1.png', 'products/01JZVKPCBJ0AK4J2RJRQX0F88E.jpg', 'products/01JWMDEQTW8BRNJP9S34A0J8WB.png', 'products/01JZVKPCBNESRFYTS2ZT7N2BDD.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:14:52', '2025-07-20 05:32:31', 'DITA BENZAL®\nDisinfektan & Antiseptik Spektrum Luas\nKementan RI: D.24124969PTC.1\n\nAroma Wangi dan Aman Untuk Disinfeksi Rumah Sakit, \nKlinik, Farm, Peralatan, Lingkungan Rumah Tinggal serta \narea publik lainnya.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA BENZAL®\nBroad Spectrum Disinfectant & Antiseptic\nKementan RI: D.24124969PTC.1\n\nFragrant and Safe Aroma for Disinfection of Hospitals,\nClinics, Farms, Livestock Equipment, Home Environments\nand other public areas.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITA BENZAL®\nDisinfektan & Antiseptik Spektrum Luas\n\nINDIKASI:\nDisinfektan yang sangat efektif membunuh berbagai macam \nvirus, bakteri dan jamur.\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap Liter mengandung:\nBenzalkonium Chloride ............................................... 200 gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nBenzalkonium Chloride merupakan senyawa amonium \nkuartener yang digunakan dalam formulasi farmasetikal \nsebagai anti mikroba dan anti jamur.\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI:\nSanitasi area tercemar ringan: 2 L/400 L Air \nSanitasi area tercemar berat: 2 L/250 L Air\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN:\n100 Ml, 1 L, 5 L, 20 L\n\n', 'DITA BENZAL®\nBroad Spectrum Disinfectant & Antiseptic\n\nINDICATION:\nA highly effective disinfectant that kills various kinds of viruses, bacteria and fungi.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach Liter contains:\nBenzalkonium Chloride .................................................... 200 grams\n\nHOW MEDICATION WORKS:\nBenzalkonium Chloride is a quaternary ammonium compound which is used in pharmaceutical formulations as an anti-microbial and anti-fungal agent.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nSanitizing lightly polluted areas: 2 L/400 L Water\nSanitizing heavily polluted areas: 2 L/250 L Water\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n100 mL, 1 L, 5 L, 20 L\n\n', 1),
(33, 8, 'DITADINE', 'DITADINE', 'ditadine', 'products/01JZ091X8BWNTEQY91YJMWQ6QD.jpg', 'products/01JWMDFXW23E84TAC95GERJS2Z.png', 'products/01JZVKRTTAJR5HZGJNHPNQED0F.jpg', 'products/01JWMDFXW513J4QRS46P2C24GA.png', 'products/01JZVKRTTDRWW3QGK0RNXNNH5A.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:15:31', '2025-07-20 05:39:55', 'DITADINE®\nDisinfektan & Antiseptik Spektrum Luas\nKementan RI: No. D.20026245 PTC\n\nUntuk Disinfeksi Kandang, Lingkungan dan Peralatan\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITADINE®\nBroad Spectrum Disinfectant & Antiseptic\nKementan RI: No. D20026245 PTC\n\nFor Disinfection of Enclosures, Environments and Equipment\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DITADINE®\nDisinfektan & Antiseptik Spektrum Luas\n\nINDIKASI:\n- Membasmi virus, bakteri dan jamur\n- Disinfektan kandang dan peralatan\n- Sterilisasi air minum dan lingkungan kandang\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap Liter mengandung:\nIodine ................................................................................... 30 gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nIodine adalah sebuah polimer larut air, antiseptik berbasis \niodine dengan cakupan luas aktivitas antimikrobanya. \nIodine memusnahkan semua patogen utama berikut \nspora-sporanya yang sulit diatasi oleh disinfektan dan \nantiseptik lain.\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI:\nDisinfektan umum:\n2 ml DITADINE dilarutkan dalam 1 liter air\nSterilisasi air minum:\n0,4 ml DITADINE dilarutkan dalam 2 liter air\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN:\n100 ml, 1, 5, dan 20 L', 'DITADINE®\n\nINDICATION:\n-Eradicate viruses, bacteria and fungi\n\n-Disinfect cages and equipment\n\n-Sterilization of drinking water and cage environment\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach Liter contains:\nIodine ....................................................................................... 30 grams\n\nHOW MEDICATION WORKS:\nIodine is a water-soluble polymer, iodine-based antiseptic with a wide range of antimicrobial activity. Iodine destroys all major pathogens and their spores which are difficult to treat with other disinfectants and antiseptics.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nGeneral disinfectants:\n2 ml DITADINE dissolved in 1 liter of water\nDrinking water sterilization:\n0.4 ml DITADINE dissolved in 2 liters of water\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n100 ml, 1, 5, and 20 L\n\n', 1),
(34, 8, 'VIROBLOCK', 'VIROBLOCK', 'viroblock', 'products/01JZ092F3JRE7N2TVGA2AFH534.jpg', 'products/01JWMDHQFD3RGG45K9820BGWD8.png', 'products/01JZVKSV95SXY8SNV5X25NWPPE.jpg', 'products/01JWMDHQFG2ZQWM0KDA3H8PQT9.png', 'products/01JZVKSV98A4P2MT1WNYKPWD1Z.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:16:30', '2025-07-20 05:50:10', 'VIROBLOCK®\nDisinfektan & Antiseptik Spektrum Luas\nKementan RI: No. D20076546 PTC\n\nWangi dan Aman Untuk Disinfeksi Rumah Sakit, Klinik, \nFarm, Peralatan, Lingkungan Rumah Tinggal serta area \npublik lainnya.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'VIROBLOCK®\nBroad Spectrum Disinfectant & Antiseptic\nKementan RI: No. D20076546 PTC\n\nFragrant and Safe for Disinfecting Hospitals, Clinics, Farms, Equipment, Residential Environments and other public areas.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'VIROBLOCK®\nDisinfektan & Antiseptik Spektrum Luas\n\nINDIKASI:\nUntuk Disinfeksi Rumah Sakit, Klinik, Farm, Peralatan, \nLingkungan Rumah Tinggal serta area publik lainnya.\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap liter mengandung:\nBenzalkonium Chloride ......................................................... 100 gr\nGlutaraldehyde ....................................................................... 150 gr\nAquadest .................................................................................. Ad 1 L\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nBenzalkonium Chloride merupakan senyawa amonium \nkuartener yang digunakan dalam formulasi farmasetikal \nsebagai anti mikroba dan anti jamur. Glutaraldehyde \nmemiliki aktivitas antimikrobial broadspectrum yang tinggi \ndalam melawan bakteri, spora bakteri, fungi dan virus.\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI:\nDisinfeksi lingkungan, kandang dan peralatan:\n- di daerah wabah: 5 ml/ 2,5 L air\n- di daerah bukan wabah: 5 ml/ 4 L air\nDisinfeksi telur: 5 ml/ 6 L air\nDisinfeksi air minum: 1 ml/ 6 L air minum\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN:\n1, 5 , dan 20 L', 'VIROBLOCK®\nBroad Spectrum Disinfectant & Antiseptic\n\nINDICATION:\nFor Disinfection of Hospitals, Clinics, Farms, Equipment, Residential Environments and other public areas.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nEach liter contains:\nBenzalkonium Chloride ............................................................ 100 gr\nGlutaraldehyde .......................................................................... 150 gr\nAquades ....................................................................................... Ad 1 L\n\nHOW MEDICATION WORKS:\nBenzalkonium Chloride is a quaternary ammonium compound which is used in pharmaceutical formulations as an anti-microbial and anti-fungal agent. Glutaraldehyde has high broadspectrum antimicrobial activity against bacteria, bacterial spores, fungi and viruses.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nDisinfection of environment, cages and equipment:\n\nin outbreak areas: 5 ml / 2.5 L water\n\nin non-epidemic areas: 5 ml / 4 L of water\nEgg disinfection: 5 ml / 6 L water\nDisinfection of drinking water: 1 ml / 6 L of drinking water\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n1, 5, and 20 L', 1),
(35, 8, 'VIDOSEP', 'VIDOSEP', 'vidosep', 'products/01JZ0934C59RWQBT4FC33B6310.jpg', 'products/01JWMDK2NJ2T22EGTTJSE9ARJQ.png', 'products/01JZVKTPNV41S2QY25C7ETKZCY.jpg', 'products/01JWMDK2NP5SE6FM8XZYPMDPK8.png', 'products/01JZVKTPP0Y6ECZGG7C1NAJWR2.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:17:14', '2025-07-20 05:59:47', 'VIDOSEP®\nDisinfektan & Sanitasi Air\nKementan RI: No. D.240172410PBC\n\n- Disinfeksi ruang secara umum, kandang, peralatan \nkandang, mesin tetas, kendaraan dan tempat susu\n- Sanitasi air minum untuk ternak\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nSADITA\nProdusen dan distributor Obat Hewan\n\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842 Website: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'VIDOSEP®\nDisinfectant\nKementan RI: No. D240172410PBC\n\n-General disinfection of the room, cages, cage equipment, hatching machines, vehicles and milk containers\n\n-Drinking water sanitation for livestock\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nHighway Serpong, Warehouse Complex Bizhub\nBlok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia\nTelephone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'VIDOSEP®\nDisinfektan & Sanitasi Air\n\nNDIKASI:\n- Disinfeksi ruang secara umum, kandang, peralatan kandang, \nmesin tetas, kendaraan dan tempat susu\n- Sanitasi air minum untuk ternak\n\nKOMPOSISI:\nSetiap liter mengandung:\nPovidone Iodine .................................................................. 30 gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT:\nDisinfektan golongan lodophore, bersifat germisisdal, \nsporisidal, fungisidal, bakterisidal, dan virusidal. Dalam \naplikasinya tidak meninggalkan noda, tidak berbau, dan \ntidak bersifat korosif\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI:\n- Untuk pemakaian umum, dosis 10 ml / 10 liter air\n- Untuk pemakaian saat wabah penyakit, dosis 20 ml / 10 liter \nair\n- Sterilisasi air minum ternak, dosis 15 ml / 10 liter air\n\nPENYIMPANAN:\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN:\n100 ml, 1 dan 20 Liter', 'VIDOSEP®\nDisinfectant\n\nINDICATION:\nGeneral disinfection of the room, cages, cage equipment, hatching machines, vehicles and milk containers\n\nDrinking water sanitation for livestock\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nSetiap liter mengandung:\nPovidone Iodine ............................................................... 30 gram\n\nHOW MEDICATION WORKS:\nIodophore class disinfectants are germicidal, sporicidal, fungicidal, bactericidal and virucidal. In its application it does not leave stains, has no smell, and is not corrosive.\n\nDOSAGE AND DIRECTION OF USE:\nFor general use, dose 10 ml / 10 liters of water\n\nFor use during disease outbreaks, dose 20 ml / 10 liters of water\n\nSterilization of livestock drinking water, dose 15 ml / 10 liters of water\n\nSTORAGE:\nStore in a dry place and protected from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING:\n100 ml, 1 and 20 Liters', 1),
(36, 9, 'BIOMIX', 'BIOMIX', 'biomix', 'products/01JZ093QQM7H17DSRQ0AMM5B0F.jpg', 'products/01JWMDPK86SX36V2F4KX5E7T22.png', 'products/01JZVKY7YSZSTX5B8468KAPDYW.jpg', 'products/01JWMDPK897BYE58J1XZYSG7D6.png', 'products/01JZVKY7YWRNFCP725MBSYETDM.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:19:10', '2025-12-07 19:40:47', 'BIOMIX®\nProbiotik Unggas\nKementan RI: No. D.20046400FTS\n\nMembantu kinerja metabolisme tubuh secara maksimal\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor,\nJawa Barat – Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id\n\nSADITA\nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan', 'BIOMIX®\nPoultry Probiotics\nIndonesian Ministry of Agriculture: No. D.20046400FTS\n\nHelps maximize the body\'s metabolic performance\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Bizhub Warehouse Complex Block GF No. 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor,\nWest Java – Indonesia | Phone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id\n\nSADITA\nAnimal Medicine Manufacturer & Distributor', 'BIOMIX®\nProbiotik Unggas\n\nINDIKASI\n\nMeningkatkan daya cerna protein dan asam amino sehingga kebutuhan nutrisi untuk hidup pokok dan produksi telur serta daging dapat terpenuhi.\n\nMampu mengatasi toksin yang ada di dalam pakan dan saluran pencernaan sehingga tidak memerlukan lagi anti toksin.\n\nMembantu kinerja metabolisme tubuh secara maksimal, sehingga tetap bekerja dalam suhu dan kondisi yang ekstrim.\n\nMeningkatkan ketersediaan phosphor dan energi tubuh.\n\nBiomix mampu menjaga mikroflora usus dan mampu mengeliminasi pengaruh bakteri patogen sehingga daya tahan tubuh akan maksimal.\n\nKOMPOSISI\nSetiap kg mengandung:\nLactobacillus acidophilus .................................................... ≥ 1×10⁶ CFU\nStreptococcus thermophilus ................................................ ≥ 1×10⁶ CFU\nSoy bean meal ........................................................................ 300 gram\nDedak ....................................................................................... 700 gram\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI\n\n3–5 kg/ton pakan\n\nJangan diberikan bersamaan dengan anti jamur atau anti mold.\n\nPENYIMPANAN\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN\n1 Kilogram\n\nSADITA\nProdusen & Distributor Obat Hewan', 'BIOMIX®\nPoultry Probiotics\n\nINDICATIONS\n\nImproves protein and amino acid digestion so that nutritional requirements for basic life and egg and meat production can be met.\n\nAble to overcome toxins in feed and the digestive tract so that anti-toxins are no longer needed.\n\nHelps maximize the body\'s metabolic performance so that it continues to function in extreme temperatures and conditions.\n\nIncreases the availability of phosphorus and energy in the body.\n\nBiomix maintains intestinal microflora and eliminates the effects of pathogenic bacteria, maximizing the body\'s resistance.\n\nCOMPOSITION\nEach kg contains:\nLactobacillus acidophilus .................................................... ≥ 1×10⁶ CFU\nStreptococcus thermophilus ................................................ ≥ 1×10⁶ CFU\nSoybean meal ........................................................................ 300 grams\nBran ....................................................................................... 700 grams\n\nDOSAGE & USAGE INSTRUCTIONS\n\n3–5 kg/ton of feed\n\nDo not administer simultaneously with antifungal or anti-mold agents.\n\nSTORAGE\nStore in a dry place away from direct sunlight\n\nPACKAGING\n1 Kilogram\n\nSADITA\nManufacturer & Distributor of Animal Medicines', 1);
