(37, 9, 'IMMUNO PLUS', 'IMMUNO PLUS', 'immuno-plus', 'products/01JZ094CTR2K2FZK5YSWD78V1G.jpg', 'products/01JWMDQY3TNCSER212945N2QAW.png', 'products/01JZVKZ7VBFJSKFZ9RK060316F.jpg', 'products/01JWMDQY3X1K42QH2XXH9K1KE3.png', 'products/01JZVKZ7VEAJFSER4ZVTEF3JF1.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:19:54', '2025-12-07 20:02:37', 'IMMUNO PLUS®\nMultivitamin, Mineral & Asam Amino\nKementan RI: No. D 2108540 PBS\n\nMeningkatkan imunitas, Memacu pertumbuhan,\nMeningkatkan produksi dan berat hasil panen.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor,\nJawa Barat – Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'IMMUNO PLUS®\nMultivitamins, Minerals & Amino Acids\nIndonesian Ministry of Agriculture: No. D 2108540 PBS\n\nBoosts immunity, Stimulates growth,\nIncreases production and crop yield.\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Bizhub Warehouse Complex Block GF No. 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor,\nWest Java – Indonesia | Phone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'IMMUNO PLUS®\nMultivitamin, Mineral & Asam Amino\n\nINDIKASI\nUntuk meningkatkan imunitas udang/ikan\n\nUntuk memacu pertumbuhan udang/ikan\n\nUntuk meningkatkan produksi dan berat hasil panen\n\nKOMPOSISI (Setiap kg mengandung):\nVitamin A ............... 1.100.000 IU\n\nVitamin E ............... 1.500 mg\n\nVitamin B1 ............. 240 mg\n\nVitamin B2 ............. 500 mg\n\nVitamin B6 ............. 400 mg\n\nVitamin B12 ........... 900 mg\n\nCa‑d‑Panthotenate ..... 5.000 mg\n\nNicotinic acid ........... 5.000 mg\n\nFolic acid ................. 50 mg\n\nMineral & Asam Amino:\n\nCholin Chloride ........ 25.000 mg\n\nDL‑Methionine ........ 15.000 mg\n\nL‑Lysine .................. 5.000 mg\n\nZinc .......................... 3.000 mg\n\nFerrous ..................... 2.400 mg\n\nIodium ....................... 100 mg\n\nSelenium .................... 40 mg\n\nCarrier ....................... Ad 1 Kg\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI\nCampur 2–3 kg ke dalam 1 ton pakan udang/ikan, selama 3–4 hari berturut-turut.\n\nPENYIMPANAN\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar dari cahaya matahari.\n\nKEMASAN\n1 Kilogram', 'IMMUNO PLUS®\nMultivitamins, Minerals & Amino Acids\n\nINDICATIONS\nTo boost the immunity of shrimp/fish\n\nTo stimulate the growth of shrimp/fish\n\nTo increase production and harvest weight\n\nCOMPOSITION (Each kg contains):\nVitamin A ............... 1,100,000 IU\n\nVitamin E ............... 1,500 mg\n\nVitamin B1 ............. 240 mg\n\nVitamin B2 ............. 500 mg\n\nVitamin B6 ............. 400 mg\n\nVitamin B12 ........... 900 mg\n\nCa‑d‑Panthotenate ..... 5,000 mg\n\nNicotinic acid ........... 5,000 mg\n\nFolic acid ................. 50 mg\n\nMinerals & Amino Acids:\n\nCholine Chloride ........ 25,000 mg\n\nDL-Methionine ........ 15,000 mg\n\nL-Lysine .................. 5,000 mg\n\nZinc .......................... 3,000 mg\n\nFerrous ..................... 2,400 mg\n\nIodine ....................... 100 mg\n\nSelenium .................... 40 mg\n\nCarrier ....................... Ad 1 Kg\n\nDOSAGE & USAGE INSTRUCTIONS\nMix 2–3 kg into 1 ton of shrimp/fish feed for 3–4 consecutive days.\n\nSTORAGE\nStore in a dry place away from direct sunlight.\n\nPACKAGING\n1 Kilogram', 1),
(38, 9, 'DITAMIX FS', 'DITAMIX FS', 'ditamix-fs', 'products/01JZ0953ASZQZA1M2VM24DPP8T.jpg', 'products/01JWMDT7WZW5RQCHYPYNH463ZG.png', 'products/01JZVPBGX0KAWZ2KRMRR30VWN3.jpg', 'products/01JWMDT7X2ZZPFS70MAQ7FXPYY.png', 'products/01JZVPBGX58A6CJNE1P21RW38A.jpg', '2025-05-31 17:21:09', '2025-12-07 20:18:14', 'DitaMix FS®\nMultivitamin, Mineral, Asam Amino dan Anti Jamur\nKementan RI: No. D.16095153FTS\n\nManfaat (Indikasi)\nMemacu dan meningkatkan pertumbuhan ternak.\n\nMeningkatkan produktivitas ternak (baik daging maupun telur).\n\nGambar Pendukung\nFoto kandang ayam petelur.\n\nFoto kambing/sapi di kandang.\n\nGambar ternak: ayam, bebek, kambing, sapi, ayam petelur dengan telur.\n\nInformasi Produsen\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No.6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat – Indonesia\nTelepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DitaMix FS®\nMultivitamins, Minerals, Amino Acids, and Antifungal Agents\nIndonesian Ministry of Agriculture: No. D.16095153FTS\n\nBenefits (Indications)\nStimulates and enhances livestock growth.\n\nIncreases livestock productivity (both meat and eggs).\n\nSupporting Images\nPhoto of a laying hen coop.\n\nPhoto of goats/cattle in a pen.\n\nLivestock images: chickens, ducks, goats, cattle, laying hens with eggs.\n\nManufacturer Information\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan Bizhub Blok GF No.6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, West Java – Indonesia\nPhone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://saditaindonesia.co.id', 'DitaMix FS\n\nMultivitamin, Mineral, Asam Amino dan Anti Jamur\n\nINDIKASI\n- Meningkatkan pertumbuhan dan imunitas ternak\n- Memacu produktivitas daging dan telur\n- Melengkapi kebutuhan vitamin, asam amino dan mineral\n\nKOMPOSISI\nSetiap kg mengandung:\nVitamin A ...... 1.100.000 IU\nVitamin D3 ...... 200.000 IU\nVitamin E (50%) ...... 1.500 mg\nVitamin B1 ...... 240 mg\nVitamin B2 ...... 500 mg\nVitamin B6 ...... 400 mg\nMetionin ...... 15.000 mg\nLysine ...... 5.000 mg\nMangan (II) sulfat ...... 5.000 mg\nZinc Sulfate ...... 3.000 mg\nFerrous Sulfate ...... 2.400 mg\nCu (CuSO4) ...... 1.000 mg\nSe (NaSe3) ...... 40 mg\n\nDOSIS & ATURAN PAKAI\nCampur 1-5 kg dalam 1 ton pakan\nPENYIMPANAN\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN\n1 Kilogram', 'DitaMix FS\n\nMultivitamins, Minerals, Amino Acids, and Antifungal Agents\n\nINDICATIONS\n- Enhances livestock growth and immunity\n- Boosts meat and egg productivity\n- Supplements vitamin, amino acid, and mineral requirements\n\nCOMPOSITION\nEach kg contains:\nVitamin A ...... 1,100,000 IU\nVitamin D3 ...... 200,000 IU\nVitamin E (50%) ...... 1,500 mg\nVitamin B1 ...... 240 mg\nVitamin B2 ...... 500 mg\nVitamin B6 ...... 400 mg\nMethionine ...... 15,000 mg\nLysine ...... 5,000 mg\nManganese (II) sulfate ...... 5,000 mg\nZinc sulfate ...... 3,000 mg\nFerrous sulfate ...... 2,400 mg\nCopper (CuSO₄) ...... 1,000 mg\nSelenium (NaSe₃) ...... 40 mg\n\nDOSAGE & USAGE INSTRUCTIONS\nMix 1-5 kg per 1 ton of feed\nSTORAGE\nStore in a dry place away from direct sunlight\n\nPACKAGING\n1 Kilogram', 1),
(40, 4, 'DOXYTA', 'DOXYTA', 'doxyta', 'products/01JWSN4NBQRKXX1KHSX9HNDNCM.png', 'products/01JWSN4NBTXJ6K21ZKW30VJFQQ.png', 'products/01JZVPKYV5QF1FAYSJ8ZYG1NAD.jpg', 'products/01JWSN4NBW14FPQ2PJNKV9PDKX.png', 'products/01JZVPKYV8AQP0KTENM34YRQ58.jpg', '2025-06-02 18:05:23', '2025-12-07 20:20:50', 'DORYTA\nObat CRD\nKementan RI: No. D.25034999PKS.1\n\nUntuk pengobatan CRD yang disebabkan Mycoplasma disertai infeksi sekunder oleh human E-Coli\n\nP.T. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan\nBizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor,\nJawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://sadftaindonesia.co.id', 'DORYTA\nCRD Medicine\nIndonesian Ministry of Agriculture: No. D.25034999PKS.1\n\nFor the treatment of CRD caused by Mycoplasma accompanied by secondary infection by human E-Coli\n\nP.T. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Pergudangan Complex\nBizhub Block GF No. 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor,\nWest Java - Indonesia | Phone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://sadftaindonesia.co.id', 'DOXYTA\nObat CRD\n\nINDIKASI\nUntuk pengobatan CRD yang disebabkan Mycoplasma disertai infeksi sekunder oleh kuman E-Coli\n\nKOMPOSISI\nSetiap 1 kg mengandung:\nDoksisiklin ......25 gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT\nDoxycycline adalah antibiotik golongan tetrasiklin. Doxycycline bekerja secara bakteriostatik dengan mencegah sintesa protein mikroorganisme. Doxycycline mempunyai spektrum kerja yang luas terhadap bakteri gram positif dan gram negatif.\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI\nUnggas: 0,1 gram per kg berat badan atau 1 gram per 2 liter air minum, diberikan selama 3-5 hari berturut-turut\n\nPENYIMPANAN\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN\n100 gr, 250 gr, & 1 Kg\n\nSADITA\nPresident & Distributor Obst Human', 'DOXYTA\nCRD Medicine\n\nINDICATIONS\nFor the treatment of CRD caused by Mycoplasma accompanied by secondary infection by E-Coli bacteria\n\nCOMPOSITION\nEach 1 kg contains:\nDoxycycline ......25 grams\n\nMECHANISM OF ACTION\nDoxycycline is a tetracycline antibiotic. Doxycycline acts bacteriostatically by inhibiting protein synthesis in microorganisms. Doxycycline has a broad spectrum of activity against both Gram-positive and Gram-negative bacteria.\n\nDOSAGE AND ADMINISTRATION\nPoultry: 0.1 grams per kg of body weight or 1 gram per 2 liters of drinking water, administered for 3-5 consecutive days\n\nSTORAGE\nStore in a dry place away from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING\n100 g, 250 g, & 1 kg\n\nSADITA\nPresident & Distributor Obst Human', 1),
(41, 4, 'OXYTHRO', 'OXYTHRO', 'oxythro', 'products/01JWSN5VN3A16D5NQ6CVA8PY1D.png', 'products/01JWSN5VN5VN8C12DPE0H3RB40.png', 'products/01JZVPN0WZ4M05GCFMK8M2SE5P.jpg', 'products/01JWSN5VN8C9XDZ4EEXZ6RCKPV.png', 'products/01JZVPN0X2FXJHGDG8CHSC7B48.jpg', '2025-06-02 18:06:02', '2025-12-07 20:27:19', 'OXYTHRO\nAntibiotik Unggas\n\nKementan RI: No. D.240372505PKS\n\nSebagai antibakteri yang peka terhadap Erythromycine\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan\nBizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor,\nJawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://sadita.id', 'OXYTHRO\nPoultry Antibiotics\n\nIndonesian Ministry of Agriculture: No. D.240372505PKS\n\nAs an antibacterial agent sensitive to Erythromycin\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Pergudangan Complex\nBizhub Block GF No. 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor,\nWest Java - Indonesia | Phone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://sadita.id', 'OXYTHRO\nAntibiotik Unggas\n\nINDIKASI\nSebagai antibakteri yang peka terhadap Erythromycine\n\nKOMPOSISI\nSetiap 1 kg mengandung:\nErythromycin......100gram\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT\nEritromisin merupakan antibiotik golongan makrolida, bekerja bakteriostatis terhadap bakteri gram positif dengan mekanisme kerja menghambat sintesa protein melalui pengikatan reversible pada ribosom bakteri.\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI\nUnggas: 1 gram per 2 liter air minum atau 0,2 gram per kg berat badan, diberikan selama 3-5 hari berturut-turut\n\nPENYIMPANAN\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhadap cahaya matahari\n\nKEMASAN\n250 gram dan 100 gram', 'OXYTHRO\nPoultry Antibiotics\n\nINDICATIONS\nAs an antibacterial agent sensitive to Erythromycin\n\nCOMPOSITION\nEach 1 kg contains:\nErythromycin......100 grams\n\nMECHANISM OF ACTION\nErythromycin is a macrolide antibiotic that acts bacteriostatically against gram-positive bacteria by inhibiting protein synthesis through reversible binding to bacterial ribosomes.\n\nDOSAGE AND ADMINISTRATION\nPoultry: 1 gram per 2 liters of drinking water or 0.2 grams per kg of body weight, administered for 3-5 consecutive days\n\nSTORAGE\nStore in a dry place away from sunlight\n\nPACKAGING\n250 grams and 100 grams', 1),
(42, 9, 'BACID PRO LB', 'BACID PRO LB', 'bacid-pro-lb', 'products/01JZ095QHM0W8ZN3WF8BC4J4J6.jpg', 'products/01JWSN75T3HZ3P2GK7BPAR1S0G.png', 'products/01JZVPCNDMFMMXW7T1PJYZ958K.jpg', 'products/01JWSN75T67H8YX45YH25EKAX6.png', 'products/01JZVPCNDREEHG8ZWWFY4Y3VWZ.jpg', '2025-06-02 18:06:45', '2025-12-07 20:30:15', 'BACIID PRO LB\nPemacu pertumbuhan dan berat badan\nKementan RI: No. D.20026246FTS\n\nMemacu dan Meningkatkan Pertumbuhan serta Produktivitas Ternak (Daging dan Telur)\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Komplek Pergudangan\nBizhub Blok GF No 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, Jawa Barat - Indonesia | Telepon: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://sadita.id\n\n', 'BACIID PRO LB\nGrowth and weight gain accelerator\nIndonesian Ministry of Agriculture: No. D.20026246FTS\n\nAccelerates and increases livestock growth and productivity (meat and eggs)\n\nPT. SATWA MEDIKA UTAMA\nJalan Raya Serpong, Pergudangan Complex\nBizhub Block GF No. 6, Gunung Sindur, Bogor, West Java - Indonesia | Phone: 0811444842\nWebsite: https://sadita.id\n', 'BACIID PRO LB\nPemacu pertumbuhan dan berat badan\n\nINDIKASI\nBACID PRO LB adalah suplement yang membantu meningkatkan pertumbuhan dan berat badan ternak, serta meningkatkan produksi daging dan telur. Selain itu, BACID PRO LB juga berfungsi menstabilkan mikroflora usus, meningkatkan kegunaan nutrisi makanan ternak, menekan kematian, dan memperbaiki konversi ransum. Kelebihan BACID PRO LB adalah mengandung asam butirat tanpa bau, stabil dalam proses pelleting dan mixing pakan, pelepasan secara perlahan-lahan di sepanjang saluran usus, dan dosis pemakaian yang rendah.\n\nCARA KERJA OBAT\nSebagai acidifier yang dilepaskan ke seluruh lapisan usus dengan menggunakan encapsulated asam butirat yang tertanam dalam minyak sayur dan gula, sehingga memaksimalkan proses absorpsi nutrisi dan berfungsi sebagai energi untuk pertumbuhan villi usus.\n\nKOMPOSISI\nSetiap Kilogram Mengandung:\nAcidifier (Butyrat Acid) ...... 200 gr\nAsam Humat ...... 110 gr\nKalsium Karbonat ...... Ad 1 kg\n\nDOSIS DAN ATURAN PAKAI\n\nBroiler, Grower dan Itik: 1 kg/ton pakan\n\nLayer: 1,3 - 1,5 kg/ton pakan\n\nSapi, Kambing dan Ternak besar lainnya: 1-2 kg/ton pakan\n\nKEMASAN\n100, 250, 500 gram dan 1 Kilogram\n\nPENYIMPANAN\nSimpan di tempat kering dan terhindar cahaya matahari', 'BACIID PRO LB\nGrowth and weight gain promoter\n\nINDICATIONS\nBACID PRO LB is a supplement that helps increase livestock growth and weight, as well as meat and egg production. In addition, BACID PRO LB also stabilizes intestinal microflora, improves the nutritional value of livestock feed, reduces mortality, and improves feed conversion. The advantages of BACID PRO LB include containing odorless butyric acid, stability during pelleting and feed mixing processes, slow-release throughout the intestinal tract, and low dosage requirements.\n\nHOW THE MEDICINE WORKS\nAs an acidifier that is released throughout the intestinal lining using encapsulated butyric acid embedded in vegetable oil and sugar, it maximizes the absorption of nutrients and functions as energy for intestinal villi growth.\n\nCOMPOSITION\nEach Kilogram Contains:\nAcidifier (Butyric Acid) ...... 200 g\nHumic Acid ...... 110 g\nCalcium Carbonate ...... Ad 1 kg\n\nDOSAGE AND USAGE RULES\n\nBroilers, Growers, and Ducks: 1 kg/ton of feed\n\nLayers: 1.3–1.5 kg/ton of feed\n\nCattle, Goats, and Other Large Livestock: 1–2 kg/ton of feed\n\nPACKAGING\n100, 250, 500 grams, and 1 Kilogram\n\nSTORAGE\nStore in a dry place away from direct sunlight', 1),
(43, 5, 'BIO MINERAL', NULL, 'bio-mineral', 'products/01JWSQF4HE25XX3TN0PGKW1TX3.jpg', 'products/01JWSQF4HHHGD6H50XCH7FHNND.png', NULL, 'products/01JWSQF4HK206X4Z6T65EC2Z7A.png', NULL, '2025-06-02 18:46:03', '2025-06-02 18:46:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1);

